Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["II.3 The recursion of the potential and the ground states", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6bbe5dbf-ef07-4655-a8d5-7b28f4146e0c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The task asks to change the potential until all three methods admit a \
superfluid. ",
 StyleBox["The effective couplings.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " For a uniform state whose normal self-energy is a Dirac mass and whose \
pair self-energy lies in the channel ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["K",
     FontFamily->"Helvetica",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "145805a0-900d-4ebc-b383-ca02001a50fc"],
 ", every method acts through two numbers: the scalar coupling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["S",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ce2f6f60-176a-491f-a613-7b2ad579eacc"],
 " (the shift of the Dirac mass per unit scalar density) and the pair \
coupling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["P",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "38b4d1a4-cf9c-42d4-b752-b40d428594ad"],
 " (the pair self-energy per unit pair amplitude), computed by ",
 StyleBox["effCouplings",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " from the self-energy maps of the terms. The normal vacuum is unstable \
towards pairing when ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["P",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["P",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "/", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["crit",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ">", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9836531d-2997-425d-bf53-ce3f96df74c5"],
 ", with the critical pair coupling of AS3,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d81496c2-d49c-4b90-b30f-3bef48505b80"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["crit",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
   FractionBox[
    SuperscriptBox["\[Pi]", "2"], 
    RowBox[{
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["SF",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}]}]], ",", "      ", 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    StyleBox["M", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "0", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["q", "TI"], "2"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
     StyleBox["dq", "TI"]}], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["q", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["M", "TI"], "2"]}], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]]], "\[LongEqual]", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "+", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], "2"]}], ")"}], 
      RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]], "-", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["M", "TI"], "2"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
     StyleBox["arsinh",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     FractionBox["1", 
      StyleBox["M", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "."}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 FontFamily->"Times",
 FontSize->1.25 
  Inherited,ExpressionUUID->"6cebe0c7-40e7-4a52-bfd8-6b476c8d2dc8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The three potentials.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a91b347f-6641-4527-b7ed-f62144aabb4d"],
 " (the author's: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["S",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"-", "8"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "74b79eee-dfc3-440d-bb17-430899fcc7b5"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0.8"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "71a60c94-dc34-4aaf-8143-802341463966"],
 ", no pairing term) admits no superfluid in any method. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b78617b8-c42e-4413-894d-fab9ef9ee74b"],
 " adds the pairing term with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "22.5"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1ed767f2-ac45-4b25-9134-877f73a627df"],
 ", the value of AS3: HS becomes superfluid, but in KS and CJT the exchange \
contraction of the pairing term acts in the scalar channel as an attraction, \
the scalar channel becomes unstable, and the ground state is a massive state. \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5c547ec2-7435-47d7-b468-2c3fccda3ea7"],
 " keeps the form and the vector coupling and fixes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["S",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d94557e6-c781-4e32-bfe5-cffeb1305252"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2c309525-60b1-4058-ac0b-c967b885dfbe"],
 " by two conditions on the CJT couplings: the scalar coupling of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8aa376b5-aeaf-4e07-b737-eb05d7e5192c"],
 " (stable) and the pair coupling of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b590b5d0-7166-4437-9351-9a02c1ae1702"],
 " (supercritical). The couplings are linear in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["SF",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox["S",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9d449f65-fd0e-4833-a69d-35c040137716"],
 ", so the conditions are two linear equations, which the next cell solves \
from the computed couplings; the solution is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["S",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "2.8"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
